{"id":"u125","kelas":"travel","no":4,"judul":"Bepergian di Kota","title":"Getting Around","emoji":"🚇","ringkas":"Taksi, bus, kereta, tiket, dan bertanya arah","ready":true,"goals":["membeli **tiket** dan memilih transportasi","bertanya **arah dan jalur** dalam bahasa Inggris","memahami kata **stasiun dan halte**: platform, transfer, fare","memakai pola *How do I get to ...?* dan *Which bus goes to ...?*"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Di kota asing kamu perlu naik taksi, bus, atau kereta dan bertanya arah. Pelajari kata penting dan pola **How do I get to ...?** serta **Which platform ...?**"},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Transportasi","items":[{"en":"taxi","id":"taksi","ex":"Can you call a taxi for me?"},{"en":"bus stop","id":"halte bus","ex":"The bus stop is near the corner."},{"en":"subway","id":"kereta bawah tanah","ex":"Take the subway to the airport."},{"en":"ticket machine","id":"mesin tiket","ex":"Buy a ticket at the ticket machine."},{"en":"one-way ticket","id":"tiket sekali jalan","ex":"One one-way ticket to the city, please."},{"en":"return ticket","id":"tiket pulang pergi","ex":"A return ticket, please."},{"en":"fare","id":"ongkos","ex":"What is the fare to the airport?"},{"en":"timetable","id":"jadwal","ex":"Check the timetable at the station."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Di stasiun dan di jalan","items":[{"en":"platform","id":"peron","ex":"The train leaves from platform four."},{"en":"transfer","id":"pindah jalur","ex":"You need to transfer at Central Station."},{"en":"exit","id":"pintu keluar","ex":"Take exit two."},{"en":"traffic jam","id":"kemacetan","ex":"We are stuck in a traffic jam."},{"en":"crossing","id":"tempat penyeberangan","ex":"Use the crossing."},{"en":"one-way street","id":"jalan satu arah","ex":"This is a one-way street."},{"en":"map","id":"peta","ex":"Do you have a map?"},{"en":"lost","id":"tersesat","ex":"Excuse me, I am lost."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Menanyakan arah","items":[{"en":"straight ahead","id":"lurus ke depan","ex":"Go straight ahead for two blocks."},{"en":"turn left","id":"belok kiri","ex":"Turn left at the traffic light."},{"en":"turn right","id":"belok kanan","ex":"Turn right after the bank."},{"en":"on your left","id":"di sebelah kirimu","ex":"The station is on your left."},{"en":"opposite","id":"di seberang","ex":"The cafe is opposite the museum."},{"en":"next to","id":"di sebelah","ex":"The pharmacy is next to the bank."},{"en":"block","id":"blok jalan","ex":"It is two blocks from here."},{"en":"walking distance","id":"bisa ditempuh jalan kaki","ex":"The hotel is within walking distance."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Bertanya arah","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Excuse me, how do I get to the museum?","id":"Permisi, bagaimana cara ke museum?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Go straight ahead and turn left at the traffic light.","id":"Lurus saja lalu belok kiri di lampu lalu lintas."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Is it far?","id":"Apakah jauh?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"No, it is within walking distance. It is next to the bank.","id":"Tidak, bisa jalan kaki. Letaknya di sebelah bank."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Thank you very much.","id":"Terima kasih banyak."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"You're welcome.","id":"Sama-sama."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Saat bertanya arah, ulangi arahan yang kamu dengar (*Turn left at the light, right?*) untuk memastikan kamu paham."},{"t":"summary","items":["Transportasi: [[taxi]], [[bus stop]], [[subway]], [[ticket machine]], [[one-way ticket]], [[return ticket]].","Di stasiun dan di jalan: [[platform]], [[transfer]], [[exit]], [[traffic jam]], [[crossing]], [[one-way street]].","Menanyakan arah: [[straight ahead]], [[turn left]], [[turn right]], [[on your left]], [[opposite]], [[next to]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"taxi\"?","options":["taksi","peron","di seberang","pintu keluar"],"answer":0,"exp":"taxi = taksi.","k":"c1617c5e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"taksi\" adalah...","options":["taxi","on your left","fare","crossi